Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.90,H_id,,0,0,0,,Sistem memberi teknologi BATERAI. "Besok dia kasih MILYARAN."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.90,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_id,,0,0,0,,Menciptakan benda dari ketiadaan —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,S_id,,0,0,0,,Ini hadiah dari sistem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.82,S_id,,0,0,0,,Ada apa di dalamnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.10,S_id,,0,0,0,,Teknologi lengkap baterai lithium-udara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.94,S_id,,0,0,0,,Catatan sistem menulis begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:06.88,S_id,,0,0,0,,Anak muda,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.02,S_id,,0,0,0,,sekarang kau sudah membuktikan sistemmu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:08.96,S_id,,0,0,0,,kemungkinan besar asli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.14,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu tahu artinya apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:11.08,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.02,S_id,,0,0,0,,Artinya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:12.96,S_id,,0,0,0,,kamu akan naik jabatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.06,S_id,,0,0,0,,Serius dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.02,S_id,,0,0,0,,Silakan, Pak Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.10,S_id,,0,0,0,,Keberadaan sistem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.04,S_id,,0,0,0,,berarti kau memiliki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.66,S_id,,0,0,0,,guna pengubah takdir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.34,S_id,,0,0,0,,Hari ini dia kirim teknologi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.28,S_id,,0,0,0,,Besok
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.58,S_id,,0,0,0,,bisa kirim puluhan miliar uang tunai,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.82,S_id,,0,0,0,,bahkan kekuatan super.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.30,S_id,,0,0,0,,Selama kau diam-diam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:27.38,S_id,,0,0,0,,kau bisa jadi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:28.86,S_id,,0,0,0,,protagonis dunia ini.
